OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers join police search for
OL,4,ANoah Woods, 3, after he went missing
OL,5,Afrom playground
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of members of the public are
OL,8,Fhelping with the search but police have
OL,9,Fasked for all efforts to be
OL,10,Fco-ordinated by them
OL,12,F"I just saw the news and needed to come
OL,13,Fdown and help," Melissa Dark, a local
OL,14,Fmother of two, tells our reporter
OL,16,FNoah is described as being white with
OL,17,Fcurly ginger hair, and is partially
OL,18,Fdeaf and non-verbal - what we know
OL,19,Fabout the missing three-year-old
